The '''Titanium Fruit''' is a [[Fruit Treasures|Fruit Treasure]] found in [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. It improves the effect of most [[:Category:Anti-Metal Cats|anti-Metal]] [[Special Abilities|abilities]].

==Effect==
At 100% on all Titanium Fruit Treasures, the following [[Special Abilities|abilities]] are enhanced when used against [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal Enemies]]:
{{Fruit Treasures Effect}} All damage-increasing abilities only apply properly to [[Critical Hit]]s, as non-Critical hits will only deal 1 damage.

