==Trivia==
*Despite being listed sixth in the [[Treasure]] menu, the Titanium Fruit is the second obtainable Cats of the Cosmos Treasure.
*The Titanium Fruit originally only improved the Weaken effect's duration by 10% and the Knockback effect's distance by 20%. This was changed at an unknown date.
*Since there are currently no [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitters]] that deal massive or insane damage to Metal enemies, the bonus given to said abilities can never be seen in normal gameplay.
*The Titanium Fruit, like other fruits is based on a real-life fruit, this one being a pineapple.
